  data: {
    LLM: 'Try to win tricks with numeral cards only. Avoid playing high cards that might win tricks containing figures. Get rid of Aces early if you think they will win.\n\nTrack which figures have been played. Force opponents to win tricks with figures by playing cards they must overtake. Void yourself in suits where you hold high cards.\n\nCard counting is essential with 32 cards. Calculate when to win a trick to reach safety. Understand the timing of when to transition from avoiding tricks to seeking them.',
    Player: 'Try to win tricks with numeral cards only. Avoid playing high cards that might win tricks containing figures. Get rid of Aces early if you think they will win.\n\nTrack which figures have been played. Force opponents to win tricks with figures by playing cards they must overtake. Void yourself in suits where you hold high cards.\n\nCard counting is essential with 32 cards. Calculate when to win a trick to reach safety. Understand the timing of when to transition from avoiding tricks to seeking them.',
